1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,250
5 words to never say in AI copywriting.

2
00:00:04,430 --> 00:00:12,760
[PAIRS - rapid fire]
Don't say in today's world, instead say right now - because people

3
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:14,860
timeless.

4
00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:20,220
Don't say utilize, instead say use - short words win.

5
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:25,990
Don't say empower, instead say help - empower is corporate noise.

6
00:00:26,170 --> 00:00:32,360
Don't say game-changer, instead say turns things around - cliche alerts.

7
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:38,040
Don't say leverage, instead say apply - leveraged is AI-slop.

8
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:43,040
Your AI copywriting does not have to sound like everyone else's.

9
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:47,180
Comment 'START' and I will send you the full list.

10
00:00:47,360 --> 00:00:51,560
Make sure you follow - it only goes to followers.
